{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2021-07-08 12:00:00', 'title': "WEYERHAEUSER COMPLETES SALE OF 145,000 ACRES OF TIMBERLANDS IN WASHINGTON'S NORTH CASCADES", 'text': 'SEATTLE, JULY 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY \xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF THE SALE OF 145,000 ACRES OF TIMBERLANDS IN THE NORTH CASCADES REGION OF WASHINGTON TO HAMPTON RESOURCES FOR $266 MILLION. THE TRANSACTION WAS ANNOUNCED IN APRIL 2021 , AND THE COMPANY ANTICIPATES NO TAX LIABILITY IN CONJUNCTION WITH THE SALE.'}